### HackerNews Scraper API Tests
### Use VS Code REST Client or Bruno/Postman to run these

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Register User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 

### Extract Token from login response (Manual copy/paste if not using env vars in REST client)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### 3. Trigger Scraper
POST {{baseUrl}}/scrape

###

### 4. Get All Stories
# @name getStories
GET {{baseUrl}}/stories

###

### Extract first story ID
@storyId = {{getStories.response.body.0._id}}

###

### 5. Get Single Story
GET {{baseUrl}}/stories/{{storyId}}

###

### 6. Toggle Bookmark (Requires valid JWT Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stories/{{storyId}}/bookmark
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
